sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Trigger the CSMS to send a ReserveNowRequest for a specific EVSE

    CSMS->>CS: ReserveNowRequest
    Note over CSMS: Validation: evseId must be the configured evseId<br>connectorType must be omitted<br>idToken.idToken = configured valid_idtoken_idtoken<br>idToken.type = configured valid_idtoken_type
    CS-->>CSMS: ReserveNowResponse (status = Accepted)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Test System notifies the CSMS about the current state of the connector(s) of the configured EVSE
    CS->>CSMS: StatusNotificationRequest (connectorStatus = Reserved) / NotifyEventRequest (trigger = Delta, actualValue = Reserved, component.name = Connector, variable.name = AvailabilityState)
    CSMS-->>CS: Responds accordingly (StatusNotificationResponse / NotifyEventResponse)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Test System notifies the CSMS about the current state of the connector(s) of the configured EVSE
    CS->>CSMS: StatusNotificationRequest (connectorStatus = Faulted) / NotifyEventRequest (trigger = Delta, actualValue = Faulted, component.name = Connector, variable.name = AvailabilityState)
    CSMS-->>CS: Responds accordingly (StatusNotificationResponse / NotifyEventResponse)

    CS->>CSMS: ReservationStatusUpdateRequest (reservationUpdateStatus = Removed, reservationId = id received at step 1)
    CSMS-->>CS: ReservationStatusUpdateResponse
